# Proposed M₂₄ Sylow double-coset representatives

The 510 image tables come from the diagnostic calculation with the four
marked Sylow generators. The inverse identities are checked in Lean. `Covers`
is the separate exhaustiveness obligation on the actual Witt-design carrier;
no coverage assertion follows just from the tables.

The obstruction calculation only uses these permutations after expressing a
native M₂₄ element with native left and right Sylow factors. Thus it does not
assume an identification with a separately constructed permutation group.

Source context: Aschbacher–Smith, printed p.511; GLS3 Table 5.3e; Aschbacher,
*Sporadic Groups*, Chapter 7, §20. See `source/README.md` for data provenance.
